{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvM1x34jmuZrMoGA9GY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with **מיטב, the track called \"עוקב מדדי מניות\"**. I'm fairly sure, not totally. What decided it was the return: **25.86%** for 3 years and **17.25%** for 5 years, the highest pair I saw. Meitav is a name I know from ads. Its fee, 0.65%, was a bit higher than some, but they all sat between about 0.5% and 0.7%, so it didn't feel like it mattered.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **First screen:** big heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". The \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" button was already lit up, so I knew I was in the right place.\n- I saw a row of filter buttons and didn't touch them. \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\" caught my eye because it's what my friends talk about.\n- Then I just scrolled the big table, company by company:\n  - **הראל:** \"מניות\" 24.04%, S&P 500 13.7%.\n  - **מור:** \"מניות\" 22.48%.\n  - **אנליסט:** \"עוקב מדדים - גמיש\" 26.39%. That's even higher, but I've never heard of Analyst, so I didn't trust it.\n  - **מיטב:** 25.86% / 17.25%. This was the one that clicked.\n  - Then I only glanced at אלטשולר שחם and הפניקס.\n- I stopped about halfway, around screen 8 of 16, because the table just kept going. I never looked at the rest.\n\n**What I skipped:**\n- The grey line under the heading about 2025 and \"רשות שוק ההון\".\n- The \"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\" link.\n- The search box and all the little \"?\" icons.\n- The \"כסף מנוהל\" column. I saw \"מיליארד\" and \"מיליון\" but didn't know what to do with them.\n\n**What I didn't get:**\n- \"חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח\". It shows two percentages with yellow and green circles, and I had no idea what the circles meant.\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" where the return should be. Does that mean no number at all?\n- \"ההפקדות 0%\" next to \"ההחסכון 0.65%\". Two different fees? I just looked at the first one.\n- \"אג\"ח\" and \"מט\"ח\". I skipped those words.\n- \"עוד לא דווח\" with an orange warning icon, which put me off those rows.\n- The header says \"לפני דמי ניהול\", so I'm not sure what I'd actually get after fees.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- 143 tracks with nothing saying \"start here\". Same names over and over, like \"כללי\", \"מניות\" and \"עוקב מדדי מניות\", at every company.\n- The same track type showed totally different numbers at different companies. Meitav's \"עוקב מדדי מניות\" was 25.86%, but Phoenix's was 9.34%. That made me unsure I'm comparing like with like.\n- The S&P 500 tracks I came for showed lower numbers (13% or so) than the \"מניות\" ones, which confused me.\n- Nothing told me what to actually do first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3750,"cache_read_input_tokens":15594,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3750},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2ac1d7b-f9ea-478d-97c8-b30882670493","uuid":"1c86eeb8-3322-4094-af65-a2307f51ab26","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:55:13.226Z","request_id":"req_011CgkvM1jPCDY87KD6EtsGD"}
